{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17348","headline":"和张秘监阁老献岁过蒋大拾遗因呈两省诸公幷见示 · 权德舆","name":"和张秘监阁老献岁过蒋大拾遗因呈两省诸公幷见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二贤同载笔，久次入新年。\n焚草淹轻秩，藏书厌旧编。\n竹风晴翠动，松雪瑞光鲜。\n庆赐行春令，从兹伫九迁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}